PACKAGE DESCRIPTION:
xf_kit1:  XFree86 3.1 Linkkit (part one)
xf_kit1: 
xf_kit1:  If you want or need to rebuild an XFree86 3.1 server you need this
xf_kit1:  package in addition to the base configuration and the programmers kit.
xf_kit1:  It is not needed for other X program development.
xf_kit1:
xf_kit1:  When rebuilding all the servers (including PEX) you will typically
xf_kit1:  need an additional 10MB of disk space.  If you are building just a
xf_kit1:  single server you will need 2MB (2.5MB with PEX) of space.
